{"prompt": {"messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "You are a helpful assistant that translates Java code to GNU C++11 code. The code should reads and writes I/O from the console."}, {"role": "user", "content": "Translate the following Java 11 code to GNU C++11 code. The code reads and writes I/O from the console. Your translated code should have the exact same functionality as the given code, meaning that it should have the same output for any given input.\nPrint your translated code and also the confidence score you give to your translation. The confidence score should be a number between 0 and 1. The format of the output should be:\n<translated_code>\n<your_translated_code>\n</translated_code>\n<confidence>\n<your_confidence_score>\n</confidence>\nDo not provide any other text or markdown fences.\n\nHere is the original Java 11 code you have to translate:\n<original_code>\nimport java.io.*;\nimport java.util.*;\n\npublic class Main{\n\tstatic int mod=998244353;\n\tstatic long fastpow(long n,long ti) {\n\t\t if (ti == 0) \n\t\t        return 1l;\n\t\tif(ti%2==0) {\n\t\t\tlong y=fastpow(n, ti/2);\n\t\t\tlong k=y*y;\n\t\t\tk%=mod;\n\t\t\treturn k;\n\t\t}\n\t\telse {\n\t\t\tlong y=fastpow(n, ti/2);\n\t\t\tlong k=((n*y)%mod)*y;\n\t\t\tk%=mod;\n\t\t\treturn k;\n\t\t}\n\t}\n\t\n\t// compute nCr using multiplicative formula with modular inverses\n\tstatic long ncr(int n, int k) {\n\t\tif (k < 0 || k > n) return 0;\n\t\tif (k == 0 || k == n) return 1;\n\t\tlong res = 1;\n\t\t// use symmetry: choose smaller k\n\t\tif (k > n - k) k = n - k;\n\t\tfor (int i = 1; i <= k; i++) {\n\t\t\tres = res * (n - i + 1) % mod;\n\t\t\tres = res * fastpow(i, mod - 2) % mod;\n\t\t}\n\t\treturn res;\n\t}\n\t\n\tpublic static void main(String[] args) throws Exception{\n\t\tBufferedReader br = new BufferedReader(new InputStreamReader(System.in));\n\t\tStringTokenizer st = new StringTokenizer(br.readLine());\n\t\tint n = Integer.parseInt(st.nextToken());\n\t\tlong k = Long.parseLong(st.nextToken());\n\t\t\n\t\tif(k>=n) {\n\t\t\tSystem.out.println(0);\n\t\t\treturn;\n\t\t}\n\t\tif(k==0) {\n\t\t\t// compute n! on the fly\n\t\t\tlong fact = 1;\n\t\t\tfor (int i = 2; i <= n; i++) fact = fact * i % mod;\n\t\t\tSystem.out.println(fact);\n\t\t\treturn;\n\t\t}\n\t\tif(k==n-1) {\n\t\t\tSystem.out.println(2*n);\n\t\t\treturn;\n\t\t}\n\t\t//columns to fill with one rook\n\t\tint filledCols=(int)(n-k);\n\t\t\n\t\tlong waysToChooseFilledCols=ncr(n, filledCols);\n\t\t\n\t\tlong ans=0;\n\t\tint sign = 1; // sign for inclusion-exclusion\n\t\tfor(int emptyCols=0;emptyCols<=filledCols;emptyCols++) {\n\t\t\tlong waysToChoose=ncr(filledCols, emptyCols);\n\t\t\tlong waysToFill=fastpow(filledCols-emptyCols, n);\n\t\t\tlong val=(waysToChoose*waysToFill)%mod;\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\tif (sign == -1) {\n\t\t\t\tval = (mod - val) % mod;\n\t\t\t}\n\t\t\tans = (ans + val) % mod;\n\t\t\tsign = -sign; // toggle sign for next iteration\n\t\t}\n\t\tans=(ans*waysToChooseFilledCols)%mod;\n\t\t\n\t\t//the same for rows\n\t\tans=(ans*2)%mod;\n\t\t\n\t\tSystem.out.println(ans);\n\t}\n}\n</original_code>\n"}], "temp": 0, "sample_size": 1, "logprobs": true, "model": "deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash"}, "response": {"samples": [{"content": "<translated_code>\n#include <iostream>\n#include <string>\n#include <sstream>\nusing namespace std;\n\nconst long long mod = 998244353;\n\nlong long fastpow(long long n, long long ti) {\n    if (ti == 0) return 1LL;\n    if (ti % 2 == 0) {\n        long long y = fastpow(n, ti / 2);\n        long long k = y * y % mod;\n        return k;\n    } else {\n        long long y = fastpow(n, ti / 2);\n        long long k = ((n * y) % mod) * y % mod;\n        return k;\n    }\n}\n\nlong long ncr(int n, int k) {\n    if (k < 0 || k > n) return 0;\n    if (k == 0 || k == n) return 1;\n    long long res = 1;\n    if (k > n - k) k = n - k;\n    for (int i = 1; i <= k; i++) {\n        res = res * (n - i + 1) % mod;\n        res = res * fastpow(i, mod - 2) % mod;\n    }\n    return res;\n}\n\nint main() {\n    ios::sync_with_stdio(false);\n    cin.tie(nullptr);\n\n    string line;\n    getline(cin, line);\n    stringstream ss(line);\n    int n;\n    long long k;\n    ss >> n >> k;\n\n    if (k >= n) {\n        cout << 0 << '\\n';\n        return 0;\n    }\n    if (k == 0) {\n        long long fact = 1;\n        for (int i = 2; i <= n; i++) fact = fact * i % mod;\n        cout << fact << '\\n';\n        return 0;\n    }\n    if (k == n - 1) {\n        cout << 2LL * n << '\\n';\n        return 0;\n    }\n\n    int filledCols = (int)(n - k);\n    long long waysToChooseFilledCols = ncr(n, filledCols);\n\n    long long ans = 0;\n    int sign = 1;\n    for (int emptyCols = 0; emptyCols <= filledCols; emptyCols++) {\n        long long waysToChoose = ncr(filledCols, emptyCols);\n        long long waysToFill = fastpow(filledCols - emptyCols, n);\n        long long val = waysToChoose * waysToFill % mod;\n        if (sign == -1) {\n            val = (mod - val) % mod;\n        }\n        ans = (ans + val) % mod;\n        sign = -sign;\n    }\n    ans = ans * waysToChooseFilledCols % mod;\n    ans = ans * 2 % mod;\n    cout << ans << '\\n';\n    return 0;\n}\n</translated_code>\n<confidence>\n1.0\n</confidence>", "token_logprobs": [-0.0005669178790412843, -1.1920928244535389e-07, -3.576278118089249e-07, -0.0001734344696160406, -2.884823152271565e-05, -4.768360213347478e-06, -0.0032131255138665438, -0.0009328543092124164, -0.030461695045232773, 0.0, -0.2053529918193817, -9.500529267825186e-05, -7.617183291586116e-05, 0.0, -0.0003334919747430831, 0.0, -0.3133930563926697, -0.2531784474849701, -5.960462772236497e-07, 0.0, -0.2014216184616089, -0.013915658928453922, -0.008617358282208443, -2.3841855067985307e-07, -0.38687166571617126, -2.1457441107486375e-05, 0.0, 0.0, 0.0, 0.0, -0.06200021877884865, -0.0005585778853856027, 0.0, -4.7205765440594405e-05, -2.47952248173533e-05, -4.768370445162873e-07, -1.1920928244535389e-07, -8.344646857949556e-07, 0.0, -8.344646